## netlab-corpus v1
## id: c20-history-clear
## kind: router
## topo: two-router-link
## provenance: authored
## note: exec lines enter history, key/drain steps never do; size arm
## note: re-binds the ring; clears are session ops; link-flap events
## note: drain deterministically off the wired r1 port.

enable
conf t
hostname H1
interface g0/0
no shutdown
shutdown
no shutdown
exit
end
## drain
show history
terminal history size 3
show history
terminal history size 0
show history
terminal history size 10
show version
clear arp-cache
clear counters
clear ip route *
clear mac address-table
show logging buffered
show history
